   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\">\n  <li>Which of the following is an equation for the table of values?</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"os-raise-horizontaltable unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span data-math=\"y\">y</span></th>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>17</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [
